235
00:15:03,069 --> 00:15:04,526
Fuck you, Frankenstein!

236
00:15:04,612 --> 00:15:05,819
Break it up, pinheads!

237
00:15:06,572 --> 00:15:08,734
- Back to what you were doing.
- I didn't do nothin'.

238
00:15:10,326 --> 00:15:11,486
